    186.17999267578125,
    595.5980834960938,
    216.187255859375,
    605.4981079101562
   ],
   "block": 46,
   "size": 8.907171249389648,
   "fonts": [
    "KoPubDotumMedium"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "관련산출물 검토예시",
   "bbox": [
    357.7200012207031,
    595.5980834960938,
    427.3883056640625,
    605.4981079101562
   ],
   "block": 46,
   "size": 8.907171249389648,
   "fonts": [
    "KoPubDotumMedium"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "1-1 요구사항정의서에 설계항목에 대한 대책이 수립되어 있으며, 아키텍처 ",
   "bbox": [
    76.6802978515625,
    610.2384033203125,
    328.24517822265625,
    620.138427734375
   ],
   "block": 47,
   "size": 8.907171249389648,
   "fonts": [
    "KoPubDotumLight"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "설계서에 설계항목 적용계획이 수립되어 있고, 요구사항추적표로 요구",
   "bbox": [
    95.28057861328125,
    623.3180541992188,
    325.69580078125,
    633.2180786132812
   ],
   "block": 47,
   "size": 8.907171249389648,
   "fonts": [
    "KoPubDotumLight"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "사항 추적 가능 여부 확인",
   "bbox": [
    95.28057861328125,
    636.33837890625,
    178.09152221679688,
    646.2384033203125
   ],
   "block": 47,
   "size": 8.907171249389648,
   "fonts": [
    "KoPubDotumLight"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "요구사항정의서, 요구사항추적표, ",
   "bbox": [
    337.38043212890625,
    616.7786865234375,
    449.44140625,
    626.6787109375
   ],
   "block": 48,
   "size": 8.907171249389648,
   "fonts": [
    "KoPubDotumLight"
   ]
  },
